      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have proposed new config terms here for payload (proposed: payload_required) and data (proposed: data_mapping) to better capture the purpose of these fields.\n\nFor payload we are saying this payload must be present in the event otherwise we ignore the event. For data we\u0027re saying use these mappings to build our event data within Zuul. I think both of these new names are more descriptive and make it easier to understand what is happening. I\u0027m open to other terms too but payload and data seem to generic.\n\nNote I haven\u0027t updated the code yet. Once we decide on the names I\u0027ll update the schema and the related fields within the driver.",
